    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "British photographer, filmmaker and artist (b. 1992, Essex), based in Los Angeles. Character-driven, saturated Americana; shape-shifting self-portraiture. Books: Women (2020), Hello My Name Is (IDEA, 2021); solo shows at Jeffrey Deitch LA (2022); represented by Fahey/Klein and Deitch. Campaigns: Balenciaga, Schiaparelli, Gucci, Miu Miu, D&G x SKIMS, Gentle Monster. Music film for A$AP Rocky, Tyler the Creator, Kali Uchis. Has shot Rihanna, Kim Kardashian, Pamela Anderson, Sophia Loren. Autonomy 5 (estimate, unverified): self-initiated books and exhibitions define her practice; brands hire her vision. Jonathan thought she had no portfolio; she does (nadialeecohen.com, found via search, proposed as Website). Instagram capture pending Chrome setup; site images cover photography, video stills not yet captured.",
